      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "mapper": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_PRIVATE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "🌌 Aurora {{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"DD.MM\")}}, 22:00\n⚡ Kp: {{5.data[80].kp}}\n\nIn brackets: low clouds. They decide.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🇸🇪 ABISKO / KIRUNA\nAbisko {{2.data[1].hourly.cloud_cover[71]}}% ({{2.data[1].hourly.cloud_cover_low[71]}}%) · Kiruna {{2.data[2].hourly.cloud_cover[71]}}% ({{2.data[2].hourly.cloud_cover_low[71]}}%)\n\n✈️ KRN — 90 km\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=Flights%20to%20KRN%20from%20BER%20on%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}%20through%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 5); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}\n\n✈️ LLA — 340 km, +4 h\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=Flights%20to%20LLA%20from%20BER%20on%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}%20through%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 5); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🇫🇮 SAARISELKÄ — {{2.data[3].hourly.cloud_cover[71]}}% ({{2.data[3].hourly.cloud_cover_low[71]}}%)\n✈️ IVL\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=Flights%20to%20IVL%20from%20BER%20on%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}%20through%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 5); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🇫🇮 LEVI — {{2.data[4].hourly.cloud_cover[71]}}% ({{2.data[4].hourly.cloud_cover_low[71]}}%)\n✈️ KTT\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=Flights%20to%20KTT%20from%20BER%20on%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}%20through%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 5); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🇫🇮 ROVANIEMI — {{2.data[5].hourly.cloud_cover[71]}}% ({{2.data[5].hourly.cloud_cover_low[71]}}%)\n✈️ RVN\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=Flights%20to%20RVN%20from%20BER%20on%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}%20through%20{{formatDate(addDays(now; 5); \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}\n\n🌞💨 Solar wind: {{6.data[1].proton_speed}} km/s\n{{if(parseNumber(6.data[1].proton_speed) > 580; \"⚡ Looks like a coronal hole — expect a repeat around \" + formatDate(addDays(now; 27); \"DD.MM\"); )}}\n",
        "parseMode": "",
        "replyMarkup": "",
        "messageThreadId": "",
        "replyToMessageId": "",
        "replyMarkupAssembleType": "reply_markup_enter"
      },
      "metadata": {
